      "message": "If #1 works, why limit the usage to networkstack only? Why not use it everyhere?\n\nCan we add a CTS test that ensures it works? It seems quite easy:\n- Register a callback\n- Attempt to start tethering with the invalid package\n- Check that the callback is called back with a permission error.\n\nHaving a CTS test will give us confidence that this method will work on all supported Android releases and not just on future releases.",
