      "message": "Quang PTAL at request for unit test. It seems to be asking to validate the packageName that\u0027s been set in the TetheringRequest? \n\nHowever the setUid and setPackageName appear to be @hide APIs that\u0027s intended to only get used in the framework. I don\u0027t think CTS test is allowed nor supposed to set these fields",
